  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management Reform Program (Subprogram 1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed program forms a cornerstone of the Government of the Philippines&#x2019; strategy to achieve macroeconomic stability by fostering sound fiscal management, an enabling environment for the private sector, and resilience to climate change, as envisaged in the Philippine Development Plan (PDP) 2023-2028. Subprogram 1 lays the foundation for strengthening public financial management (PFM) systems for the ensuing, more targeted policy actions under subprogram 2 in line with the PFM Reforms Roadmap 2024-2028.</narrative>
  </description>
